==History==
2024
*The Goblin Curse was added to the game on 17/6/2024, in the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]] {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 19/6/2024, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (19/6/2024)|maintenance break]], decreased the Goblin Curse’s damage amplification to 35% (from 50%) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 2/7/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Curse’s damage amplification to 20% (from 35%) {{Balance|Nerf}} and decreased its radius to 3 tiles (from 4 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Curse’s damage by 20% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 30/10/2024, the [[Version History#Removal of Goblin Queen's Journey Update (30/10/2024)|Removal of Goblin Queen's Journey Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Goblin Curse from Mud Pit to Serenity Peak {{Balance|Buff}}.
2025
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], made it so that [[Lumberjack/Evolution|Lumberjack Ghost]] is immune to Goblin Curse {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 1/9/2025, the September 2025 Update, increased the Goblin Curse's damage by 17% {{Balance|Buff}}, its Crown Tower damage to 27% of its full damage (from 20%) {{Balance|Buff}}, but removed its damage boost {{Balance|Remove}}.
*On 26/9/2025, a maintenance break changed the Goblin Curse's card description. It used to read: "''And thrice were their afflictions... nixed, vexed, and hexed! Enemy troops in the area will receive extra damage from attacks and become Goblins when destroyed. Deals damage to enemies over time." {{Balance|Neutral}}''.
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, added a slowdown mechanic to the Goblin Curse

